%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: BearsWEIRD
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Who said that?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179744
    - rid: 4351268260154179745
    - rid: 4351268260154179746
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: It doesn't matter! You don't have time!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Use the gem that the armored man gave you!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: How would I-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Just do it!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki quickly whips the soul gem out of her pocket, slamming it onto
      her warhammer.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179747
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Thanks to the amount of force she put into it, the soul gem shatters.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Once the bears are within range, Natsuki swings her warhammer at them.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Upon hitting the first bear, it bursts into flames.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179748
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The second bear is distracted by the fire, which gives Natsuki the opportunity
      to ignite that one too.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179749
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The two bears, now on fire, start panicking (which, in their defence,
      most animals probably would).
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: With the opportunity she found, Natsuki capitalizes.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: She starts swing until both bears are dead.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268279254515712
    - rid: 4351268279254515713
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268279254515714
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: W-what just happened?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268279254515722
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (I was fighting those bears, then that voice-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268279254515715
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Voice...? What <i>did</i> it sound like, anyway?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268279254515716
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (... and after I heard that voice I... slapped the gem onto my warhammer
      and-)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki looks over her warhammer, noticing that it seems to give off
      some sort of heat.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268279254515717
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (If it can light bears on fire, I guess it makes sense that it's giving
      off heat...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268279254515718
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (But how? Did the strange guy give me some sort of magical fire gem,
      or something?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268279254515719
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (I guess I'll have to look into it later.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268279254515720
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: With her quest completed, despite the dangerous complications, Natsuki
      begins making her way back to Jorrvaskr to get her pay.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268279254515721
    - rid: 4351268279254515723
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
